<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<b>📘 ORDER BLOCK (Cikakken Bayani)</b></p><p>🎯 <b>Ma’ana</b></p><p>Order Block (OB) wata yankin farashi ce inda institutions (smart money) suka saka orders kafin kasuwa ta yi babban motsi.</p><p>🧠 <b>Fahimtar Concept</b></p><p>Kasuwa tana karkashin manyan ‘yan wasa (bankuna da institutions). Ba sa shiga kasuwa gaba ɗaya lokaci guda, suna tarawa a wani wuri.</p><p>Bayan sun gama:</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashi yana ɗan tsayawa</li><li>Sai ya yi motsi mai ƙarfi (impulse move)</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>👉 Wannan yankin na ƙarshe shi ake kira Order Block.</p><p>📊 <b>Nau’in Order Block</b></p><p>🟢 <b>Bullish Order Block</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Ƙarshe bearish candle kafin farashi ya tashi sosai</li><li>Yana aiki a matsayin support</li><li>Yana nuna saye mai ƙarfi</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🔴 <b>Bearish Order Block</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Ƙarshe bullish candle kafin farashi ya faɗi sosai</li><li>Yana aiki a matsayin resistance</li><li>Yana nuna sayarwa mai ƙarfi</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🔍 <b>Yadda ake gano shi</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Nemo motsi mai ƙarfi</li><li>Tabbatar da Break of Structure (BOS)</li><li>Nemo candle na ƙarshe na opposite</li><li>Yi marking zone</li><li>Jira farashi ya dawo</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>⚠️ <b>Ingantaccen Order Block</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Akwai BOS</li><li>Motsi mai ƙarfi</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Chart mai tsabta</li><li>An ɗauki liquidity</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>🧪 <b>Yadda ake trading</b></p><p>🟢 <b>Buy Setup</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Kasuwa bullish</li><li>Farashi ya dawo OB</li><li>Jira confirmation</li><li>Shiga Buy</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🔴 <b>Sell Setup</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Kasuwa bearish</li><li>Farashi ya dawo OB</li><li>Jira confirmation</li><li>Shiga Sell</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>❌ <b>Kurakurai</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Yin marking kowane candle</li><li>Shiga trade ba tare da confirmation ba</li><li>Rashin duba structure</li><li>Trading a sideways market</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🧠 <b>Psychology</b></p><p>Lokacin da farashi ya dawo OB:</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Institutions na iya samun sauran orders</li><li>Ko suna kare position ɗinsu</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>👉 Wannan yana sa farashi ya yi reaction</p><p>📌 <b>Taƙaice</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><b>Order Block</b> = yankin institutions</li><li><b>Bullish OB</b> → Buy</li><li><b>Bearish OB </b>→ Sell</li></ul><p></p><p>A haɗa da structure + confirmation</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<b>Market Structure</b></p><p>📘 <b>Ma’anar</b></p><p>Market structure na nuna yadda farashin ke motsi a chart. Yana nuna wa wane ne ke da iko: buyers (bulls) ko sellers (bears). Fahimtar market structure zai taimaka maka ka gane trend kafin ka yi trade.</p><p>🧠 <b>Fahimta</b></p><p>Ka dauki kasuwa kamar matakala:</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Idan farashin yana yin higher highs (HH) da higher lows (HL), yana hawa → bulls suna da iko.</li><li>Idan farashin yana yin lower highs (LH) da lower lows (LL), yana sauka → bears suna da iko.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>Market structure yana taimaka maka ganin babban hoto maimakon ka bi kananan motsi kawai.</p><p>📊 Nau’in Market Structure</p><p>1. <b>Bullish Structure</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin yana yin higher highs (HH) da higher lows (HL)</li><li>Yana nuna cewa buyers sun fi sellers ƙarfi</li><li>Mai kyau don neman buy entries</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>2. <b>Bearish Structure</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin yana yin lower highs (LH) da lower lows (LL)</li><li>Yana nuna cewa sellers sun fi buyers ƙarfi</li><li>Mai kyau don neman sell entries</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🔍 <b>Yadda Ake Gane Market Structure (Mataki-Mataki)</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Buɗe chart ɗinka ka zaɓi timeframe (mis. 15m, 1H, 4H).</li><li>Gano swing highs da swing lows.</li><li>Kwatanta su:</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>HH + HL → bullish</li><li>LH + LL → bearish</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 4. Zana lines a highs da lows don ganin trend.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 5. Duba higher timeframe don tabbatar da babban trend.</p><p>⚠️ <b>Sharuɗɗan Ingantacciyar Market Structure</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Dole ne a sami highs da lows guda 2 a jere don tabbatar da trend.</li><li>Structure ya zama bayyana, ba a cikin sideways ko cakude ba.</li><li>Koyaushe a tabbatar da higher timeframe alignment don ƙarin tabbaci.</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🧪 <b>Yadda Ake Trading da Market Structure</b></p><p><b>Buy Setup (Bullish Market Structure)</b></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira retracement zuwa higher low</li><li>Tabbatar da support, demand ko order block</li><li>Shiga buy da sanya stop loss ƙasa da recent low</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sell Setup (Bearish Market Structure)</b></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira retracement zuwa lower high</li><li>Tabbatar da resistance, supply ko order block</li><li>Shiga sell da sanya stop loss sama da recent high</li></ul><p></p><p>Tip: Market structure yana da ƙarfi idan yana daidaita da higher timeframe trends.</p><p>❌ <b>Kurakurai Masu Yawan Faruwa</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Yin watsi da higher timeframe trend</li><li>Trading a kasuwa sideways ko cakude</li><li>Rashin bambanci tsakanin kananan motsi da sauyin trend</li><li>Shiga ba tare da tabbaci ba kamar support ko order block</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🧠 <b>Psychology (Asirin Ka na Sirri)</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Fahimtar market structure na kawo amincewa da kanka</li><li>Kana ganin wane ne ke da iko: bulls ko bears</li><li>Yana hana tsoro da bin farashin</li><li>Kamar samun taswira kafin bincikar wuri da ba ka sani ba</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>📌 <b>Taƙaitawa</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><b>Market structure</b> = yanayin trend</li><li><b>Bullish</b> → HH + HL → neman buys</li><li><b>Bearish</b> → LH + LL → neman sells</li></ul><p></p><p>Koyaushe a duba higher timeframe kuma ka guji kasuwannin cakude</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<b>Fair Value Gap (FVG)</b></p><p>📘 <b>Ma’anar</b></p><p>Fair Value Gap (FVG) wani bambanci ne na farashi a chart inda kasuwa ta motsa da sauri sosai, tana barin wani baki tsakanin candles. Yana nuna wuraren da farashin zai iya komawa don “cika” gap kafin ci gaba da trend.</p><p>🧠 <b>Fahimta</b></p><p>Ka dauki FVG kamar rami a kasuwa:</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Lokacin da farashin ya motsa da sauri, zai iya tsallake wasu levels, yana barin gap.</li><li>Wannan gap yana da muhimmanci saboda farashin sau da yawa yana dawowa don gwadawa ko cika wannan zone kafin ci gaba da tafiya.</li><li>FVG yana taimaka wa traders su gano wurin retracement ko entry mai yiwuwa.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>📊 <b>Nau’in Fair Value Gap</b></p><p>1. <b>Bullish FVG</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya motsa sama da sauri</li><li>Gap yana bayyana kasa da farashin yanzu</li><li>Mai kyau don buy entries</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>2. <b>Bearish FVG</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya motsa kasa da sauri</li><li>Gap yana bayyana sama da farashin yanzu</li><li>Mai kyau don sell entries</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🔍 <b>Yadda Ake Gane FVG (Mataki-Mataki)</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Nemi candle mai karfi impulsive (babban motsi a hanya guda).</li><li>Gano candles 3 masu jere da suka shiga cikin motsin.</li><li>Zana FVG zone tsakanin:</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Bullish FVG: saman candle na farko → ƙasa na candle na uku</li><li>Bearish FVG: ƙasa na candle na farko → saman na candle na uku</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 4. Alama zone ɗin; farashin na iya komawa wannan yanki kafin ci gaba.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 5. Duba higher timeframe don ƙarfafa zone ɗin.</p><p>⚠️ <b>Sharuɗɗan Ingantaccen FVG</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Dole ne ya kasance daga motsi impulsive mai ƙarfi</li><li>Gap bai kamata a taba shi sosai ba bayan motsi</li><li>Ya dace da higher timeframe structure ko order blocks don ƙarin tabbaci</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🧪 <b>Yadda Ake Trading da FVG</b></p><p><b>Buy Setup (Bullish FVG)</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira farashin ya dawo cikin FVG zone</li><li>Tabbatar da order block ko support</li><li>Shiga buy, stop loss ƙasa da zone</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Sell Setup (Bearish FVG)</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira farashin ya dawo cikin FVG zone</li><li>Tabbatar da order block ko resistance</li><li>Shiga sell, stop loss sama da zone</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><b>Tip</b>: FVG yafi aiki idan yana daidai da market structure da order blocks.</p><p>❌ <b>Kurakurai Masu Yawan Faruwa</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Amfani da FVG a kasuwa sideways</li><li>Rashin duba higher timeframe alignment</li><li>Shiga kafin farashin ya dawo cikin zone</li><li>Rikicewa tsakanin kananan gaps da FVG na gaskiya</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>🧠 <b>Psychology</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>FVG na ba da fa’ida ta dabarun trading: ka san inda farashin zai iya dawowa</li><li>Yana hana shigar da impulsive entries ko bin farashin da sauri</li><li>Kamar taswira don retracement mai yiwuwa</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>📌 <b>Taƙaitawa</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><b>FVG</b> = bambanci na farashi daga motsi mai ƙarfi</li><li><b>Bullish FVG</b>: zone ƙasa da farashin → neman buys</li><li><b>Bearish FVG:</b> zone sama da farashin → neman sells</li></ul><p></p><p>Tabbatar da order blocks, support/resistance, da higher timeframes</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><b>Inducement</b></p><p>📘 <b>Ma’anar</b></p><p>Inducement wani makirci ne a kasuwa da smart money ke yi don ja retail traders cikin rashin nasara. Wani falsen signal ne da ke sa traders shiga kafin kasuwa ta juya.</p><p>🧠 <b>Fahimta</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Ka dauki inducement kamar kamar bait a cikin trap:</li><li>Farashin yana motsawa don ja traders su shiga da wuri</li><li>Yawanci yana faruwa kusa da liquidity zones, order blocks ko FVGs</li><li>Smart money na amfani da shi don tarawa stops sannan ya turawa farashin a ainihin hanyar</li></ol><p></p><p>📊 <b>Nau’in Inducement</b></p><p>1. <b>Bullish Inducement</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya karye support ko recent low na wucin gadi</li><li>Yana kunna retail sell orders, sannan ya juya sama</li><li>Dama don buy entries bayan trap</li></ul><p></p><p>2. <b>Bearish Inducement</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya karye resistance ko recent high na wucin gadi</li><li>Yana kunna retail buy orders, sannan ya juya kasa</li><li>Dama don sell entries bayan trap</li></ul><p></p><p>🔍 <b>Yadda Ake Gane Inducement (Mataki-Mataki)</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Nemi falsen break na swing high, swing low ko key level.</li><li>Duba ko motsi ya kunna cluster na retail stop orders.</li><li>Kalli reaction na farashin—shin ya kasa ci gaba a wannan hanya?</li><li>Hada da market structure, order blocks da FVGs don tabbaci.</li><li>Alama zone ɗin a matsayin potential inducement kuma shirya trade a akasin hanya.</li></ol><p></p><p>⚠️ <b>Sharuɗɗan Ingantaccen Inducement</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Dole ne ya faru kusa da key liquidity zones (swing highs/lows, order blocks, FVGs)</li><li>Yawanci yana biyo reversal a market structure</li><li>Dole ne ya kunna retail stops ko false signals</li></ul><p></p><p>🧪 <b>Yadda Ake Trading da Inducement</b></p><p><b>Buy Setup (Bullish Inducement)</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira farashin ya karye kuma ya koma ƙasa da support ko low</li><li>Tabbatar da order block, FVG ko structure</li><li>Shiga buy, stop loss ƙasa da falsen break</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sell Setup (Bearish Inducement)</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Jira farashin ya karye kuma ya koma sama da resistance ko high</li><li>Tabbatar da order block, FVG ko structure</li><li>Shiga sell, stop loss sama da falsen break</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Tip</b>: Inducement yafi aiki idan an haɗa shi da market structure, FVGs da order blocks don high probability setups.</p><p>❌ <b>Kurakurai Masu Yawan Faruwa</b></p><p></p><ol style="text-align: left;"><li>Rikicewa tsakanin real break da inducement</li><li>Shiga da wuri kafin trap ya kammala</li><li>Rashin duban higher timeframe structure</li><li>Trading inducement a kasuwa sideways</li></ol><p></p><p>🧠 <b>Psychology</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Inducement yana baka damar trading against retail traps</li><li>Yana ba da mental edge: ka san lokacin da smart money ke manipulate price</li><li>Yana hana fear-driven mistakes da chasing market</li></ul><p></p><p>📌 <b>Taƙaitawa</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li><b>Inducement</b> = falsen motsi don jan retail traders</li><li><b>Bullish inducement</b>: fake break ƙasa → dama don buy</li><li><b>Bearish inducement: </b>fake break sama → dama don sell</li></ul><p></p><p>Tabbatar da order blocks, FVGs da market structure</p>
