  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Support &amp; Resistance</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>
  <p>Support &amp; Resistance suna nuna muhimman matakan farashi inda kasuwa ke yawan yin reaction. 
  <b>Support</b> wuri ne inda masu saye suke shiga don hana farashin sauka ƙasa. 
  <b>Resistance</b> wuri ne inda masu sayarwa suke shiga don hana farashin hawa sama.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>
  <p>Ka ɗauki Support kamar bene kuma Resistance kamar rufin. Farashin yakan bounce daga waɗannan matakan. 
  Gano su yana taimaka maka samun wuraren shiga da fita da kuma hango halayen kasuwa.</p>

  <h3>📊 Nau’uka</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Horizontal Support &amp; Resistance:</b> layuka tsaye daga swings highs/lows na baya.</li>
    <li><b>Dynamic Support &amp; Resistance:</b> moving averages ko trendlines.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Gane Su (Mataki-Mataki)</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Nemo swings highs da lows na baya.</li>
    <li>Yi layi a matakan da farashin ya yawan bounce.</li>
    <li>Yi amfani da trendlines ko moving averages don dynamic S/R.</li>
    <li>Duba higher timeframe don ƙarfafa zone ɗin S/R.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Sharuɗɗa</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Level ɗin ya kamata a gwada sau biyu ko fiye.</li>
    <li>Dole ne ya dace da higher timeframe structure.</li>
    <li>Yafi karfi idan an haɗa da order blocks ko FVGs.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Trading</h3>
  <p><b>Buy Setup:</b></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya kusanci support</li><li>tabbatar da order block ko FVG</li><li>shiga buy</li><li>&nbsp;stop loss ƙasa da support.</li></ul> <p></p>
  <p><b>Sell Setup:</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya kusanci resistance</li><li>&nbsp;tabbatar da order block ko FVG</li><li>shiga sell</li><li>stop loss sama da resistance.</li></ul><p></p>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Trading S/R a kasuwar sideways/confused.</li>
    <li>Rashin duban higher timeframe alignment.</li>
    <li>Amfani da matakan rauni da ba su da tarihin reaction.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>
  <p>Support &amp; Resistance yana baka taswira na kasuwa, yana hana trades na impulsive, 
  kuma yana ƙara confidence ta nuna inda farashin zai iya yin reaction.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>
  <p><b>Support &amp; Resistance</b> = matakan farashi masu muhimmanci.<br />
  <b>Support:</b> bene → wurin saye mai yiwuwa.<br />
  <b>Resistance:</b> rufi → wurin sayarwa mai yiwuwa.<br />
  Tabbatar da order blocks, FVGs, da higher timeframe alignment.</p>
