  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Liquidity</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Liquidity shine yawan orders a kasuwa da smart money zai iya amfani da su. 

  Yana nuna wuraren da retail traders suka sanya stops da limit orders, suna haifar da <b>liquidity pools</b>.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Ka dauki liquidity kamar “mai” da smart money ke bukata don motsa kasuwa. 

  Farashin yakan motsa don <b>karbar liquidity</b> (stop hunts) kafin ya ci gaba da ainihin hanyar. 

  Fahimtar liquidity yana taimaka wa traders gano <b>wuraren shiga masu yiwuwa</b>.</p>

  <h3>📊 Nau’uka</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Stop-Loss Liquidity:</b> Orders a sama da highs ko ƙasa da lows.</li>

    <li><b>Limit Order Liquidity:</b> Buy ko sell orders da ke jiran a key levels.</li>

    <li><b>Hidden Liquidity:</b> Orders a wuraren da ba a gani sosai ga retail traders.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Gane (Mataki-Mataki)</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Nemo clusters na swing highs/lows inda retail stops ke yiwuwa.</li>

    <li>Kalli sudden moves da ke kunna stops (stop hunts).</li>

    <li>Alama liquidity zones a sama da resistance ko ƙasa da support.</li>

    <li>Hada da order blocks, FVGs da market structure don tabbaci.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Sharuɗɗa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Yana faruwa kusa da swing highs/lows, key support/resistance.</li>

    <li>Yawanci yana biyo fake break ko inducement.</li>

    <li>Higher timeframe alignment yana ƙara tabbaci.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Trading</h3>

  <p><b>Buy Setup:</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya karbi liquidity ƙasa da support</li><li>&nbsp;sannan ya juya</li><li>Shiga buy bayan tabbaci da order block ko FVG</li><li>&nbsp;Stop loss ƙasa da liquidity zone.</li></ul><p></p>

  <p><b>Sell Setup:</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya karbi liquidity sama da resistance</li><li>&nbsp;sannan ya juya.</li><li>Shiga sell bayan tabbaci da order block ko FVG</li><li>&nbsp;Stop loss sama da liquidity zone.</li></ul><p></p>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Trading liquidity zones ba tare da structure confirmation ba.</li>

    <li>Rashin duban higher timeframe alignment.</li>

    <li>Rikicewa normal volatility da real liquidity grabs.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Fahimtar liquidity yana baka damar trading <b>tare da smart money ba da kanta ba</b>, 

  yana rage tsoron fake moves, kuma yana ƙara confidence wajen shiga da fita.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p><b>Liquidity</b> = orders da smart money ke target.<br />

  Nemi stop-loss da limit order pools a sama da resistance ko ƙasa da support.<br />

  Tabbatar da order blocks, FVGs da market structure kafin shiga trade.</p>

</div>
