  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Fibonacci Retracement</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Fibonacci Retracement kayan aiki ne don gano <b>support da resistance</b> inda farashin zai iya tsayawa ko juya. 

  Ana amfani da matakan <b>23.6%, 38.2%, 50%, 61.8%, da 78.6%</b> sosai.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Fibonacci yana taimaka wa traders gano wuraren da farashin zai iya <b>tsayawa, juya ko ci gaba da trend</b>. 

  Yana aiki tare da market structure, order blocks, da FVGs don samun high-probability entries.</p>

  <h3>📊 Nau’uka</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Classic Fibonacci Retracement:</b> daga swing high zuwa swing low.</li>

    <li><b>Extended Fibonacci Levels:</b> don hasashen price targets a gaba.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Gane (Mataki-Mataki)</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Nemo latest swing high da swing low a timeframe da kake trading.</li>

    <li>Yi Fibonacci retracement daga low zuwa high (bullish) ko high zuwa low (bearish).</li>

    <li>Kalli key retracement levels inda farashin zai iya yin reaction.</li>

    <li>Haɗa da order blocks, FVG, ko S/R don tabbacin entry.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Sharuɗɗa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Yi amfani da swing points daga timeframe da ya dace.</li>

    <li>Tabbatar da wasu tools (order blocks, FVG, S/R).</li>

    <li>Trend ya kasance a bayyane; kada a yi amfani a kasuwar choppy sosai.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Trading</h3>

  <p><b>Buy Setup:</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya retrace zuwa Fibonacci level kusa da support/order block</li><li>Shiga buy bayan tabbaci</li></ul><p></p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Stop loss ƙasa da swing low.</li></ul><p></p>

  <p><b>Sell Setup:</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul style="text-align: left;"><li>Farashin ya retrace zuwa Fibonacci level kusa da resistance/order block</li><li>Shiga sell bayan tabbaci</li><li>&nbsp;Stop loss sama da swing high.</li></ul><p></p>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Amfani da Fibonacci ba tare da structure ko order blocks confirmation ba.</li>

    <li>Dogaro da exact level maimakon zone.</li>

    <li>Trading a kasuwar sideways ko unclear trend.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Fibonacci levels suna taimaka maka shiryawa da confidence, hango reactions na farashi, da kaucewa impulsive entries.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p><b>Fibonacci Retracement</b> = potential support/resistance levels.<br />

  Common levels: <b>23.6%, 38.2%, 50%, 61.8%, 78.6%</b>.<br />

  Tabbatar da market structure, order blocks ko FVGs kafin shiga trade.</p>

</div>
<div class="lesson">

  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Blockchain</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Blockchain fasaha ce ta rajistar dijital wadda ba ta da cibiyar iko guda ɗaya, 

  tana rikodin dukkanin mu’amaloli cikin aminci da gaskiya a cikin cibiyar kwamfutoci (nodes).</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Ka yi tunanin blockchain a matsayin sarkar blocks, kowanne block yana ɗauke da bayanan mu’amala. 

  Bayan an saka, ba za a iya canza bayanan ba, wanda ke tabbatar da tsaro da amincewa. 

  Yawancin cryptocurrencies kamar Bitcoin da Ethereum suna amfani da blockchain.</p>

  <h3>📊 Mahimman Abubuwa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Block:</b> Akwati ne da ke ɗauke da jerin mu’amaloli.</li>

    <li><b>Node:</b> Kwamfuta ce da ke shiga cikin cibiyar blockchain.</li>

    <li><b>Decentralization:</b> Babu wani da ke da cikakken iko akan cibiyar.</li>

    <li><b>Immutability:</b> Da zarar an rikoda mu’amala, ba za a iya canza ta ba.</li>

    <li><b>Consensus Mechanism:</b> Hanyar tabbatar da mu’amaloli (misali Proof of Work, Proof of Stake).</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Gane / Yadda Yake Aiki</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Mu’amaloli suna shiga cikin blocks.</li>

    <li>Blocks suna haɗuwa da juna cikin tsari na lokaci suna samar da sarkar.</li>

    <li>Nodes suna tabbatar da mu’amaloli ta hanyar consensus.</li>

    <li>Cibiyar tana sabuntawa, kuma blocks suna zama permanent da immutable.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Ka’idoji / Sharuɗɗa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Mu’amaloli dole ne nodes su tabbatar.</li>

    <li>Dole ne a bi ka’idojin consensus (PoW, PoS ko sauran mechanism).</li>

    <li>Da zarar an saka a blockchain, ba za a iya canza bayanan ba.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Amfani / Tasirin Trading</h3>

  <p>Fahimtar blockchain yana taimaka wa traders su:</p>

  <ul>

    <li>Zaɓi cryptocurrencies masu aminci bisa blockchain ɗin su.</li>

    <li>Fahimci tsaro da saurin mu’amaloli.</li>

    <li>Yi nazari kan blockchain projects don zuba jari ko trading.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Zuba jari ba tare da fahimtar blockchain ba.</li>

    <li>Assuming duk cryptocurrencies suna aiki iri ɗaya.</li>

    <li>Rashin la’akari da scalability ko fees na mu’amaloli.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Fahimtar blockchain yana gina confidence a crypto trading. 

  Zaka san dalilin da ya sa wasu coins suke da tsaro ko sauri, yana taimaka maka yanke shawara da hikima.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p><b>Blockchain</b> = fasahar rajistar dijital mara cibiyar iko guda ɗaya.<br />

  Mahimman abubuwa: <b>blocks, nodes, decentralization, immutability, consensus</b>.<br />

  Fahimtar blockchain yana taimaka maka nazari projects crypto da yin trading da hikima.</p>

</div>
<div class="lesson">

  <h2 style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;Risk Management</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Risk Management hanya ce ta gano, nazari, da sarrafa yiwuwar hasara a trading. 

  Yana tabbatar da cewa babu wani trade da zai iya lalata dukkan capital ɗinka.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Kyakykyawan risk management yana kare account daga manyan asara kuma yana baka damar yin trading na dogon lokaci. 

  Ya haɗa da sarrafa girman trade, amfani da stop loss, da kuma kiyaye ratio mai kyau tsakanin risk da reward.</p>

  <h3>📊 Mahimman Abubuwa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Risk per Trade:</b> Kason capital da kake son risk a trade ɗaya (1–2%).</li>

    <li><b>Position Size:</b> Girman trade bisa ga risk ɗinka.</li>

    <li><b>Stop Loss (SL):</b> Yana rage hasara.</li>

    <li><b>Take Profit (TP):</b> Yana kare riba.</li>

    <li><b>Risk/Reward Ratio:</b> Kwatanta risk da riba (misali 1:2).</li>

    <li><b>Leverage Control:</b> Sarrafa amfani da leverage.</li>

    <li><b>Diversification:</b> Raba risk a trades daban-daban.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Amfani (Mataki-Mataki)</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Ƙayyade risk per trade (1–2%).</li>

    <li>Ƙididdige position size.</li>

    <li>Sanya Stop Loss da Take Profit.</li>

    <li>Tabbatar da risk/reward ratio mai kyau (1:2 ko fiye).</li>

    <li>Daidaita leverage da risk ɗinka.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Ka’idoji</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Kada ka taba risk fiye da abin da ka tsara.</li>

    <li>Koyaushe amfani da Stop Loss.</li>

    <li>Kada ka yi over-leverage.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Trading</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Ƙididdige risk kafin shiga trade.</li>

    <li>Kare capital ya zama fifiko.</li>

    <li>Daidaita trading bisa yanayin kasuwa (volatility).</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Trading ba tare da Stop Loss ba.</li>

    <li>Amfani da leverage fiye da kima.</li>

    <li>Rashin kula da risk/reward ratio.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Risk management yana rage tsoro da yanke shawara cikin gaggawa. 

  Shine mabuɗin tsira da samun nasara a trading.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p><b>Risk Management </b>= kare capital.<br />

  Koyaushe sarrafa risk, amfani da SL/TP, kuma ka kasance mai discipline.</p>

</div>
<div class="lesson">

  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Minene Forex</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Forex (Foreign Exchange) kasuwa ce ta duniya inda ake saye da sayar da kudaden ƙasashe. 

  Traders suna musanya kudin ƙasa ɗaya da wata, kamar EUR/USD ko GBP/JPY.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Kasuwar Forex ita ce mafi girman kasuwa ta kudi a duniya. 

  Farashi yana motsawa bisa dalilan tattalin arziki, labarai (news), interest rates, da kuma sentiment na kasuwa. 

  Forex trading yana nufin hango ko kudin wata ƙasa zai ƙaru ko zai ragu idan aka kwatanta da wata.</p>

  <h3>📊 Mahimman Abubuwa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li><b>Currency Pair:</b> Kudade biyu da ake trading tare (misali EUR/USD).</li>

    <li><b>Base Currency:</b> Kudin farko a pair.</li>

    <li><b>Quote Currency:</b> Kudin biyu a pair.</li>

    <li><b>Pip:</b> Ƙaramin motsin farashi a Forex.</li>

    <li><b>Spread:</b> Bambanci tsakanin bid da ask.</li>

    <li><b>Lot Size:</b> Girman trade.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Gane / Yadda Yake Aiki</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Forex ana trading ne a cikin currency pairs.</li>

    <li>Buy = kana tsammanin base currency zai tashi.</li>

    <li>Sell = kana tsammanin base currency zai sauka.</li>

    <li>Farashi yana motsawa bisa supply, demand, da economic data.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Sharuɗɗa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Kasuwar Forex tana aiki awa 24 (Litinin zuwa Juma’a).</li>

    <li>Sessions suna shafar volatility (London, New York, Asian).</li>

    <li>News na iya kawo motsi mai ƙarfi cikin sauri.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧪 Yadda Ake Trading</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Zaɓi currency pair.</li>

    <li>Yi nazari na market structure da trend.</li>

    <li>Yi amfani da risk management (SL, TP).</li>

    <li>Kula da news da trading sessions.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>❌ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Rashin kula da news da economic data.</li>

    <li>Trading ba tare da fahimtar currency pairs ba.</li>

    <li>Amfani da leverage fiye da kima.</li>

    <li>Trading a lokacin low liquidity.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Forex trading yana bukatar haƙuri da discipline. 

  Sarrafa emotions yana da muhimmanci musamman lokacin news da high volatility.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p><b>Forex</b> = kasuwar kudade.<br />

  Mahimman abubuwa: <b>currency pairs, pip, spread, sessions</b>.<br />

  Yi trading da nazari, risk management, da kula da news.</p>

