  <h2 style="text-align: center;">Girman Kai / Greed</h2>

  <h3>📘 Ma’anar</h3>

  <p>Greed shine son samun riba fiye da kima, wanda sau da yawa ke watsi da risk, strategy, da management na trade.</p>

  <h3>🧠 Fahimta</h3>

  <p>Greed yana sa traders suyi overtrade, ƙara girman positions ba tare da hankali ba, ko riƙe trades masu asara tsawon lokaci suna fata samun riba mai yawa. 

  Wannan shine ɗaya daga cikin hanyoyin da sauri na rasa capital a trading.</p>

  <h3>📊 Mahimman Abubuwa</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Gano lokacin da son riba ya mamaye tunani.</li>

    <li>Bi ka’idojin risk management da position sizing.</li>

    <li>Sani lokacin daukar riba da fita daga trades bisa plan ɗinka.</li>

    <li>Fahimci cewa samun ƙaramin riba mai yawa cikin tsari ya fi bin manyan riba ba tare da tsari ba.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🔍 Yadda Ake Aiki</h3>

  <ol>

    <li>Saita realistic profit targets ga kowace trade.</li>

    <li>Bi strategy ɗinka ba tare da barin emotions su shiga ba.</li>

    <li>Duba trades ɗinka don tabbatar yanke shawara bisa logic ne, ba son riba ba.</li>

    <li>Riƙe journal don lura da lokacin da greed ya shafi trading ɗinka.</li>

  </ol>

  <h3>⚠️ Kurakurai</h3>

  <ul>

    <li>Bin trades don dawo da asara ko samun riba ƙari.</li>

    <li>Yi watsi da stop-loss da fatan kasuwa zata juya.</li>

    <li>Overleverage positions fiye da tolerance ɗinka na risk.</li>

  </ul>

  <h3>🧠 Psychology</h3>

  <p>Sarrafawa greed yana da muhimmanci don nasara a dogon lokaci. 

  Traders da suka iya wannan suna riƙe discipline, rage emotional mistakes, kuma suna kare capital ɗinsu.</p>

  <h3>📌 Taƙaitawa</h3>

  <p>Greed = son riba fiye da kima. 

  Mahimman abubuwa: <b>bi ka’idojin risk, bi targets, guji overtrading, mayar da hankali kan consistency</b>. 

  Ba tare da iko ba, greed yana haifar da kurakurai impulsive da asara.</p>

